WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.508 --> 00:00:13.653
Brad: Oh great!

2
00:00:13.973 --> 00:00:15.374
How are we going to defeat that?

3
00:00:15.454 --> 00:00:18.015
Danny: Just watch this!

4
00:00:20.036 --> 00:00:25.118
Tina: Uh, I’m still watching.

5
00:00:25.138 --> 00:00:28.079
Brad: Wait a minute.

6
00:00:28.579 --> 00:00:29.640
We can defeat them.

7
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:32.341
Brad: We have to do the same thing as before.

8
00:00:32.361 --> 00:00:34.963
Brad: Remember how we fixed the flower?

9
00:00:34.983 --> 00:00:36.984
Danny: You mean with powder?

10
00:00:37.004 --> 00:00:38.465
Brad: Exactly.

11
00:00:39.005 --> 00:00:40.966
Quick, make some more pepper shakers.

12
00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:46.269
Brad: Danny, you use your red one.

13
00:00:46.769 --> 00:00:47.810
I’ll take a yellow one.

14
00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:50.031
Brad: Tina, you take the other one.

15
00:00:50.451 --> 00:00:53.553
Tina: Okay, but what do we do with them?

16
00:00:53.573 --> 00:00:56.895
Brad: Sprinkle a whole bunch of powder onto your hand.

17
00:00:57.595 --> 00:00:58.536
You too, Bello.

18
00:01:02.752 --> 00:01:04.333
Bello: Colors!

19
00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:09.535
Brad: Now, blow a great big cloud of color!

20
00:01:16.177 --> 00:01:20.199
Clouds! Tina: Now what?

21
00:01:20.479 --> 00:01:21.360
Brad: We wait.

22
00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:24.801
Danny: Are you sure this is going to work?

23
00:01:25.341 --> 00:01:28.963
Brad: Well I’m not a hundred percent sure.

24
00:01:28.983 --> 00:01:30.743
Tina: Oh great.

25
00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:32.024
Now you tell us!

26
00:01:33.944 --> 00:01:38.287
Danny: It’s making them sneeze!

27
00:01:39.088 --> 00:01:43.731
Tina: Look!

28
00:01:44.212 --> 00:01:46.153
They’re sneezing out different colors!

29
00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:49.355
Brad: It’s just like Danny’s rainbow-colored key.

30
00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:53.438
Brad: You make new colors by mixing together other colors.

31
00:01:54.399 --> 00:01:59.703
Tina: Look, red and yellow make orange.

32
00:02:02.508 --> 00:02:04.469
Danny: That one is sneezing brown.

33
00:02:04.489 --> 00:02:09.571
Brad: And that one is sneezing violet.

34
00:02:09.591 --> 00:02:12.312
Tina: And something else is happening!

35
00:02:12.892 --> 00:02:13.813
Brad: Tina’s right.

36
00:02:14.233 --> 00:02:15.153
They're shrinking.

37
00:02:22.756 --> 00:02:23.817
This is great!

38
00:02:28.639 --> 00:02:31.840
Danny: And look what else is happening!

39
00:02:33.484 --> 00:02:36.046
Brad: The color is coming back to Hopian’s garden.

40
00:02:36.066 --> 00:02:37.487
Bello: Pretty.

41
00:02:37.507 --> 00:02:39.689
Tina: Bello’s right.

42
00:02:40.389 --> 00:02:41.470
It is very pretty.

43
00:02:48.415 --> 00:02:50.136
Everything is turning green again.

44
00:02:50.156 --> 00:02:51.998
Tina: Of course.

45
00:02:52.718 --> 00:02:54.440
Blue and yellow make green.

46
00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.681
Brad: It must be the water.

47
00:02:56.701 --> 00:02:59.964
Brad: Plants get water from the soil through their roots.

48
00:03:00.364 --> 00:03:04.107
Brad: The water is spreading the color to all the plants in Ginormous!

49
00:03:10.072 --> 00:03:11.294
Nice kick, Bello!

50
00:03:11.914 --> 00:03:13.996
I wish you could be on my soccer team!

51
00:03:14.476 --> 00:03:15.317
Bello: Soccer!

52
00:03:15.337 --> 00:03:18.500
Brad: Colors do such amazing things!

53
00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:22.403
Danny: The four of us do some amazing things too!
